    "遇到了特别特别特别好看的夕阳，美美拍照，还有特别棒的双彩虹！\n还见到了好久没见的小狗！\n（👇图一也是小狗哈）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We found an incredibly beautiful sunset, took lots of photos, and even saw an amazing double rainbow!\nWe also ran into a dog we hadn't seen in ages!\n(👇 And yes, photo one is also a dog.)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
